NiceGit third-party licenses
============================

This file lists the open-source components built into NiceGit, and the license each one is
used under. Each component's copyright notice and license text are included as its license
requires.

NiceGit itself is MIT-licensed; see the LICENSE file.

The Inter font (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and the Phosphor icons (MIT License) are not Rust
crates; their notices and licenses follow at the end of this file.


